SUMMARY:Martin Amini LIVE at Saint Andrew's Hall
DTSTAMP:20260721T053840Z
DTSTART:20260722T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nMartin Am
	ini is a rising star in stand-up comedy — a sharp\, relatable\, and wildly
	 funny comedian based in Washington\, D.C.\, who has been selling out club
	s and theaters across the country on his “I’m Not Toxic\, I’m Healing” Tou
	r. \nBorn and raised in Silver Spring\, Maryland\, Martin draws his comedi
	c inspiration from his uniquely diverse heritage — an Iranian father and a
	 Bolivian mother — crafting a blend of humor that resonates with audiences
	 of all backgrounds. His multicultural upbringing gives him a perspective 
	that is both deeply personal and universally hilarious. \nBeyond his herit
	age\, Martin mines his own experiences of marriage and relationships for c
	omedy gold\, delivering hilarious commentary on love\, commitment\, and th
	e everyday chaos of modern life. He is also the founder of Room 808\, a co
	median-run comedy club in Washington\, D.C.\, and is currently on a multi-
	continent tour showcasing his distinctive brand of stand-up to audiences w
	orldwide. \nKnown for his sharp wit\, storytelling ability\, and crowd wor
	k\, Martin Amini is one of the most exciting live performers on the comedy
	 circuit today. His Detroit stop at Saint Andrew’s Hall is not to be misse
	d. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 22\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM EDT \
	nVenue: Saint Andrew’s Hall — 431 E Congress St\, Detroit\, MI 48226 \nPho
	ne: (313) 961-8961 \nAge Restriction: 18+ (Fast Lane Access add-on availab
	le for eligible guests) \nContent: Stand-up comedy — adult themes and lang
	uage expected. \nAbout the Venue\nSaint Andrew’s Hall is one of Detroit’s 
	most storied and beloved live entertainment venues\, located at 431 E Cong
	ress St in the heart of downtown Detroit. With a capacity of approximately
	 1\,000\, Saint Andrew’s Hall offers an intimate\, high-energy atmosphere 
	that makes every show feel electric and up-close. \nOriginally built as a 
	Scottish fraternal hall in 1907\, the venue has been a cornerstone of Detr
	oit’s live music and comedy scene for decades. Its exposed brick walls\, b
	alcony seating\, and general admission floor create a raw\, authentic vibe
	 that perfectly suits the energy of a live stand-up comedy performance. \n
	The venue features a full bar\, excellent sightlines from both the floor a
	nd balcony\, and a sound system that ensures every punchline lands perfect
	ly. Parking is available in nearby lots and structures throughout downtown
	 Detroit. Saint Andrew’s Hall is easily accessible and centrally located\,
	 making it a perfect destination for a night out in the city. \nWhat to Ex
	pect\nExpect a high-energy\, laugh-packed evening of stand-up comedy from 
	one of the hottest touring comedians in the country. Martin Amini’s shows 
	are known for their incredible crowd work\, sharp storytelling\, and the k
	ind of relatable humor that has audiences in stitches from start to finish
	. \nThis is a solo stand-up performance in an intimate venue setting — mea
	ning you’ll be close to the stage and fully immersed in the experience. Ma
	rtin’s ability to read a room and connect with his audience in real time m
	akes every show feel unique and spontaneous. \nDoors typically open before
	 showtime. Arrive early to grab a drink at the bar and secure a great spot
	 on the floor or in the balcony. This is an 18+ event — bring your valid p
	hoto ID. Fast Lane Access add-ons are available for those who want priorit
	y entry. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $46 – $65 (prices may vary bas
	ed on seat selection and demand) \nTickets are on sale now. Martin Amini’s
	 shows have been selling out across the country — don’t wait to grab yours
	 for Detroit. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affili
	ate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://co
	medycalendar.com/event/martin-amini-live-at-saint-andrews-hall-detroit/\n\
	nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/martin-amini-live-at-saint-andrews-hal
	l-detroit/
LOCATION:Saint Andrew’s Hall\, 431 E Congress St\, Detroit\, MI\, 48226\, U
	SA
