	e for one unforgettable night! Paul Ollinger and Paul Farahvar bring their
	 unique comedic styles together for a special double-bill show at the lege
	ndary Cobb’s Comedy Club in San Francisco. Whether you know them from thei
	r stand-up specials\, podcasts\, or live performances\, this is a night of
