SUMMARY:Tommy Brennan LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club San Francisco
DTSTAMP:20260721T053840Z
DTSTART:20260723T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nTommy Bre
	nnan is a rising force in stand-up comedy\, known for his sharp\, self-awa
	re humor and his ability to find comedy in the most relatable corners of e
	veryday life. His style blends clever wordplay with honest\, personal stor
	ytelling — the kind of comedy that makes you laugh and nod at the same tim
	e. \nA regular on the national club circuit\, Tommy Brennan has been build
	ing a devoted fanbase through relentless touring and a string of standout 
	performances at some of the country’s top comedy venues. His material is c
	onsistently fresh\, well-crafted\, and delivered with a natural confidence
	 that makes him a joy to watch. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan or discove
	ring him for the first time\, Tommy Brennan’s run at Punch Line Comedy Clu
	b is not to be missed. Multiple shows across the weekend give you plenty o
	f chances to catch this rising star live. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\
	, July 23\, 2026 (also Fri July 24 & Sat July 25)\nTime: 8:00 PM PDT (Thu)
	 | 7:30 PM & 9:45 PM (Fri) | 7:00 PM & 9:15 PM (Sat)\nVenue: Punch Line Co
	medy Club – San Francisco\, 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\
	nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price Range: $29 – $51 
	\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco is one of the mo
	st storied comedy venues in the United States\, located at 444 Battery Str
	eet in San Francisco’s Financial District. Since 1978\, Punch Line has bee
	n the launching pad for comedy legends including Robin Williams\, Ellen De
	Generes\, Dana Carvey\, and countless others. \nThe club seats approximate
	ly 300 guests in an intimate table-and-chair setup that puts every audienc
	e member close to the action. A full bar and food menu are available throu
	ghout the show\, and the attentive staff ensures a seamless\, enjoyable ex
	perience from start to finish. \nConveniently located near BART and Muni s
	tops\, Punch Line is easy to reach by public transit. Parking is available
	 in nearby garages throughout the Financial District. It’s the perfect ven
	ue for a memorable night of comedy in the heart of San Francisco. \nWhat t
	o Expect\nTommy Brennan performs five shows across the weekend of July 23–
	25\, giving fans multiple opportunities to experience his comedy live. Eac
	h show is a full stand-up set — tight\, funny\, and packed with the kind o
	f material that earns him new fans every night. \nThe 18+ age restriction 
	and 2-beverage minimum are in effect for all shows. Doors open approximate
	ly 30–45 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to grab a great seat and se
	ttle in with a drink before the laughs begin. \nTicket Information\nPrice 
	Range: $29 – $51 (before taxes and fees)\nTickets are available through Ti
	cketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Ti
	ckets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no
	 extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/tommy-brennan-live
	-at-punch-line-comedy-club-san-francisco/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tommy-brennan-live-at-punch-line-comed
	y-club-san-francisco/
