DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nTony Rock is a comedian\, actor\, and producer — the younger brother 
	of Chris Rock — who has built his own legendary career in stand-up and tel
	evision. He hosted HBO’s All Def Comedy\, BET’s Apollo Live\, and co-starr
	ed in CBS’ Living Biblically. He is also the founder of the MyROCK Diabete
	s Foundation. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 
	PM (Doors open 6:00 PM) \nVenue: Arlington Improv\, 309 Curtis Mathes Way 
	#147\, Arlington\, TX 76018 \nAge Restriction: 18+ \nPrice Range: $25 to $
	70 per person \nAbout the Venue\nArlington Improv is located in the Highla
	nds Shopping Center in Arlington\, TX\, across from Torchy’s Tacos. It is 
	an intimate comedy club featuring a full bar and restaurant where guests e
	njoy world-renowned and local comics in a lively\, up-close setting. The v
	enue also hosts Black Dog Pizza Arcade with 30+ local craft beers. \nWhat 
	to Expect\nTony Rock delivers a full Friday night headlining set at Arling
	ton Improv. Expect sharp wit\, personal stories\, and commanding stage pre
	sence from one of comedy’s most seasoned performers. \nThis is an 18+ even
	t. Doors open at 6:00 PM. Food and beverage service ends approximately 45 
	minutes into the show. All sales are final. \nTicket Information\nTickets 
	range from $25 to $70 per person. Purchase official tickets or find resale
	 options below. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar
	.com/event/tony-rock-live-at-arlington-improv-friday/\n\nFrom Comedy Calen
	dar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tony-rock-live-at-arlington-improv-fri
	day/
