SUMMARY:Bruce Bruce LIVE at Addison Improv
DTSTAMP:20260721T053840Z
DTSTART:20260724T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nBruce Bruce LIVE at Addison Improv\nOne of stand-u
	p comedy’s most beloved performers is coming to Dallas! Bruce Bruce\, the 
	larger-than-life comedian known for his explosive energy and hilarious sto
	rytelling\, brings his “Cool Since Day One” tour to Addison Improv on July
	 24\, 2026. Get ready for a night of non-stop laughs with one of the funni
	est men in comedy! \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 7
	:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Addison Improv\nAddress: 4980 Belt 
	Line Road #250\, Addison (Dallas)\, TX 75254\nAge Requirement: 18+\nBevera
	ge Minimum: 2-item food or beverage minimum per person \nAbout Bruce Bruce
	\nBruce Bruce is a stand-up comedian and actor best known for his appearan
	ces on Comic View\, Last Comic Standing\, and Who’s Got Jokes?. With his b
	ooming voice\, infectious laugh\, and larger-than-life personality\, Bruce
	 has become one of the most recognizable faces in comedy. He has headlined
	 clubs and theaters across the country and continues to pack houses wherev
	er he performs. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a tru
	e comedy legend\nHilarious storytelling and crowd interaction\nAn intimate
	 comedy club experience at Addison Improv\nNon-stop laughs from start to f
	inish\nFull bar and food service available\n\nVenue Information\nAddison I
	mprov is located at 4980 Belt Line Road #250 in Addison (Dallas)\, TX\, on
	 the second floor at the southwest corner of Belt Line Road and Quorum Dri
	ve. This premier comedy club offers an intimate setting with full food and
	 bar service. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at approximately $50 and
	 are available now. This is an 18+ event with a 2-item food or beverage mi
	nimum per person. Grab your seats before they sell out! \nOfficial Tickets
	\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commissio
	n if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll
	 sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be requ
	ired for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/bruce-bruce-live-at-ad
	dison-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/bruce-bruce-live-at-addison-improv/
